    <bpmn:process id="W_W1280" name="W1280. Vendor Return-to-Vendor (RTV) Defective &amp; Excess Merchandise Processing" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Accumulation of defective, damaged, or excess merchandise qualifying for vendor return per vendor agreement terms
Frequency: Weekly per store; bi-weekly consolidated RTV shipments from DCs
Volume: ~200–300 RTV line items/month chain-wide; ~5–10 vendor return shipments/month from DCs
Owner: Category Manager
Participants: Department Supervisor, Store Receiving Clerk, DC Returns Coordinator, AP Clerk, Vendor
Source: workflow W1280 — Vendor Return-to-Vendor (RTV) Defective &amp; Excess Merchandise Processing</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W1280_LaneSet7">
        <bpmn:lane id="W1280_Lane1" name="Department Supervisor">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1280_Task9</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1280_Task10</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1280_Start8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W1280_Lane2" name="Category Manager">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1280_Task11</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1280_Task16</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W1280_Lane3" name="Vendor">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1280_Task12</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W1280_Lane4" name="Store Receiving Clerk">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1280_Task13</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W1280_Lane5" name="DC Returns Coordinator">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1280_Task14</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W1280_Lane6" name="AP Clerk">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1280_Task15</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1280_End17</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W1280_Start8" name="Accumulation of defective, damaged, or excess merchandise qualifying for vendor return…">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1280_Flow20</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1280_Task9" name="RTV eligibility identification">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: RTV eligibility identification: Department Supervisor identifies merchandise qualifying for vendor return during daily walkthrough or cycle count per W276: (a) defective items (manufacturing defect, DOA for power tools/appliances), (b) shipping damage identified at receiving per W3, (c) excess seasonal inventory per vendor markdown agreement, (d) discontinued items with vendor-authorized return window; scans item barcode to check RTV eligibility in system (vendor return window, return type, required condition)
Responsible (R): Department Supervisor
Accountable (A): Store Manager
Duration: 15 min/week</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1280_Flow20</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1280_Flow21</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1280_Task10" name="RTV request creation">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: RTV request creation: Department Supervisor creates RTV request in ERP: (a) selects item and quantity, (b) enters return reason code (defective, damaged, excess, discontinued), (c) attaches photo evidence of defect/damage, (d) system validates against vendor return policy (within return window, condition requirements met); request routes to Category Manager for approval
Responsible (R): Department Supervisor
Accountable (A): Category Manager
Duration: 5 min/item</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1280_Flow21</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1280_Flow22</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1280_Task11" name="RTV approval &amp; vendor authorization">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: RTV approval &amp; vendor authorization: Category Manager reviews RTV request: (a) verifies return reason and evidence, (b) confirms vendor return terms per W688, (c) for excess/discontinued: confirms return is more cost-effective than markdown per W93; approves or rejects; for items &gt;PHP 50K: routes to VP Merchandising; system sends RMA (Return Merchandise Authorization) request to vendor via supplier portal per W224
Responsible (R): Category Manager / VP Merchandising
Accountable (A): VP Merchandising
Duration: 10 min/batch</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1280_Flow22</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1280_Flow23</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1280_Task12" name="Vendor RMA confirmation">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 4: Vendor RMA confirmation: Vendor reviews RMA request via supplier portal; issues RMA number with shipping instructions (return to vendor warehouse, return to DC on next delivery, or destroy-in-place with credit); system records RMA number and return method
Responsible (R): Vendor / Category Manager
Accountable (A): Category Manager
Duration: 1–5 business days</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1280_Flow23</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1280_Flow24</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1280_Task13" name="RTV staging &amp; shipment">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 5: RTV staging &amp; shipment: (a) For store-originated RTV: Store Receiving Clerk stages RTV items in designated returns area; items consolidated with next DC delivery truck backhaul; (b) For DC-originated RTV: DC Returns Coordinator stages items per vendor; consolidates into RTV shipment when RMA confirmed; schedules pickup or adds to vendor&#x27;s next inbound delivery backhaul
Responsible (R): Store Receiving Clerk / DC Returns Coordinator
Accountable (A): DC Manager
Duration: 30 min/batch</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1280_Flow24</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1280_Flow25</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1280_Task14" name="Goods shipment &amp; tracking">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 6: Goods shipment &amp; tracking: RTV items shipped to vendor (or picked up by vendor); system generates RTV packing list and shipping document; inventory moved from &quot;RTV Staged&quot; to &quot;RTV In Transit&quot;; vendor confirms receipt of returned goods
Responsible (R): DC Returns Coordinator
Accountable (A): Category Manager
Duration: Per shipment</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1280_Flow25</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1280_Flow26</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1280_Task15" name="Vendor credit &amp; AP reconciliation">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 7: Vendor credit &amp; AP reconciliation: Vendor issues credit memo upon receipt and inspection of returned goods; AP Clerk matches credit memo against RTV shipment: (a) verifies credit amount matches expected (full cost, partial, or restocking fee deduction), (b) posts credit to AP vendor account, (c) if discrepancy: escalates to Category Manager for vendor negotiation per W7
Responsible (R): AP Clerk / Vendor
Accountable (A): Category Manager
Duration: 15 min/credit</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1280_Flow26</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1280_Flow27</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1280_Task16" name="Monthly RTV analytics">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 8: Monthly RTV analytics: Category Manager compiles monthly RTV report: (a) RTV value by vendor and reason code, (b) vendor RTV processing time (request to credit), (c) credit recovery rate, (d) top defect categories feeding into vendor quality scorecard per W44; identifies vendors with chronic quality issues requiring sourcing review per W36
Responsible (R): Category Manager
Accountable (A): VP Merchandising
Duration: 2 hours/month</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1280_Flow27</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1280_Flow28</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W1280_End17" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W1280_Flow28</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W1280_Annotation18">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-255 (ensure controlled execution — Inventory Disposition &amp; Optimization (PA-05.3).) | - operational: Category Manager review and approval gate; operational: periodic reconciliation against source documents
Owner: Category Manager</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W1280_Assoc19" sourceRef="W1280_Annotation18" targetRef="W1280_Start8" associationDirection="None" />
